# Proposed lifecycle; complete contract is normative and qualification remains due.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Foreground admission protocol\nComplete design → whole-k291 review → k269" {class: start}
Qualify: "Q earlier required mechanics / controls\nActual native UID / build / channel / decoder on pure inputs\nNamed B1–B8 evidence; full contact gaps accepted"
Provision: "Explicit one-time initialization\nIssuance profile + current profile / bridge\nReceipt / final validation stay DISARMED"
Final: "Last edit → disarmed requalification\nIndependent acceptance + audit\nDistinct k244 close / promotion"
Release: "Antony accepts exact eligible basis\nFresh human APPOINT over entry / request / nonce\nForeground supervisor + checker + child through true return"
Ready: "Fixed validated unspent.receipt\nHighest revision / correction; no intent"
Export: "P actual facts + accepted exact A3 entry\nImmutable issuance rule; entry accepted before lookup\nFresh export reservation precedes intent"
Intent: "Lock receipt; recheck identities\nRetain consume.intent, even partial"
Spent: "Exclusive same-directory rename\nunspent.receipt → spent.receipt"
Original: "Synchronized original start header\nAll required acknowledgements first"
Capture: "A first actual source / root outcomes\nDeclared initial / closure only; no calibration\nRetain original bytes, refusals and prefixes"
Derivative: "Offline exact-byte derivative\nIndependent association verification"
Refuse: "Unavailable / uncertain: refuse\nNo older eligibility; consumption never refunds"
Limit: "Closed Q / P blockers and exact T / A grammars\nRequired actual Q / P U blocks; A follows consumption\nDesign is no qualification; pass unused; all holds remain"
Maintenance: "Approved disarm-only maintenance\nRetain next slot / synchronized intent before changes or Q\nPartial / death / lock release never restores eligibility"
Start -> Qualify: "1 · no operation evidence supplied"
Qualify -> Provision: "1a · qualified separate initializer / validator"
Provision -> Final: "2a · external validation never arms"
Final -> Release: "2b · accepted stable closing basis"
Final -> Maintenance: "change or any requalification"
Maintenance -> Final: "new Q → acceptance / audit → distinct close"
Maintenance -> Refuse: "partial / failed / interrupted successor"
Release -> Ready: "2c · loss / stale / active Q refuses"
Ready -> Export: "3 · complete prerequisites"
Export -> Intent: "4 · valid export first"
Export -> Limit: "P refusal: end invocation; fresh entry / appointment later"
Intent -> Spent: "5 · irreversible transition"
Spent -> Original: "6 · sync and name checks"
Original -> Capture: "7 · only then contact"
Capture -> Derivative: "8 · frozen originals"
Derivative -> Limit: "9 · no new permission"
Intent -> Refuse: "4a · partial / death"
Spent -> Refuse: "5a · rename / sync failure"
Original -> Refuse: "6a · incomplete start"
Capture -> Refuse: "7a · failed / lost original"
Derivative -> Refuse: "8a · failed / lost export"
